  "description": {
   "en": "YouTuber office manager Nogawa Fumi and his younger brother Nichiyo witness a mysterious light at the World Heritage Site \"Hara Castle Ruins\". What appeared was Amakusa Shiro, the \"Son of God\" of the Edo period, who is said to have led the largest revolt in Japanese history at the age of only 16. Toshi sees in his appearance and charisma his potential as an influencer, but...?",
   "ja": "日本史上最大の一揆“島原の乱”をわずか16歳で率いた偉人・天草四郎。“神の子”と呼ばれた少年が、なぜか現代に降臨!!　YouTuber事務所のマネージャー・野川告とその弟・日生とともに、信者を集めるため“インフルエンサー”を目指すが…!?"
  },
